### 2026-08-17 session (Cline — responsive audit, Phases 4–7)
- **Phase 4 (grid consistency):** shared breakpoint ladder — `.grid-4` 4→2→1 and `.grid-6`/`.partners-grid` 6→3→1 (tablet step at 1024, single column at 640); `.grid-2` collapse moved 480→640. `.haas-relationship__grid` now 4-col → 2×2 with cross dividers (≤1024) → 1-col (≤640). Grid items get `min-width: 0` so images/long text can't force overflow.
- **Phase 5 (mobile hero alignment):** `.slide__content--left` + `.page-hero__actions` stay left-aligned at ≤768 site-wide (matches homepage peek), removing the interior-only mobile center override.
- **Phase 6 (legacy cleanup):** removed orphaned `.machine-browse` and `.machine-cards`/`.machine-card` blocks; dropped `.machine-browse` from the layout section list. (trust-strip/testimonial-split/carousel kept — cross-file, lower value.)
- **Phase 7 (Playwright verification):** installed Playwright in `/tmp` (repo kept clean). Programmatic scan of all 10 pages × 360/768/1024/1440 → **no horizontal overflow anywhere**. Fixes surfaced by the pass: header collapse breakpoint 1000→1120 (desktop nav overflowed at 1001–1119), about-page `.about-photo` grid overflow fixed via `min-width:0`, long `.btn` labels now wrap at ≤480. CSS brace-counts balanced; all pages serve 200.
- **Files:** `layout.css`, `components.css` (uncommitted).

### 2026-08-17 session (Cline — responsive audit · universal spacing, Phases 1–3)
- **Full static responsive audit** — found "weird layouts" rooted in: (1) double horizontal gutter (48px vs 24px) where a `.container` is nested inside a padded section class; (2) mixed container widths per page (1200 vs 1120); (3) hardcoded `--sp-96` block padding on full-bleed bands ignoring the `--section-y` token.
- **One gutter source:** removed `padding-inline: var(--sp-24)` from the `layout.css` section list; `.container` is now the single horizontal-gutter provider. Added `padding-inline: var(--sp-24)` to the `__inner` wrappers that don't use `.container` (why/es-grid/tech-partners/capability/credential/trust/email-signup). Fixed the 48px double-gutter bug on news, testimonials, mcs-grid (application/automation/MCS), and `.machine-lineup`.
- **One container width:** `--max-es` 1120 → 1200 (unified to `--max-home`) so hero / stat-counter / body left edges align on interior pages.
- **Token-driven vertical rhythm:** added `--section-y-lg: clamp(72px, 8.5vw, 120px)`; `.machine-lineup`, `.haas-relationship__top`, `.cta-band--cinema-lockup .cta-band__content` now use it (removed their hardcoded `--sp-96`/`--sp-64` + the fixed media overrides).
- **Files:** `tokens.css`, `layout.css`, `components.css`. CSS brace-counts verified balanced.
- **Remaining (not done):** Phase 4 breakpoint-ladder + grid-step consistency (grid-4/6, partners, haas features jump straight to 1-col), Phase 5 mobile hero alignment (homepage peek stays left, interior heroes center), Phase 6 legacy cleanup, Phase 7 Playwright screenshot pass at 360/768/1024/1440.
- **Note:** working tree already had uncommitted Cursor WIP (modal.js, several HTML, docs) — left untouched, not committed.

### 2026-08-17 session (Cursor — header responsive layout)
- **Root cause:** `.site-header__inner` lacked `width: 100%` — on mobile the flex row shrink-wrapped (logo + hamburger) and centered in the viewport, so logo no longer aligned with `.container` left inset.
- **Fix:** `width: 100%` on header + alert inners; alert bar horizontal padding unified to `var(--sp-24)` on inner (was 16px on banner). At ≤1000px hide desktop `<nav>` wrapper; hamburger gets `margin-left: auto`. ≤768px tighter header row + centered alert items; ≤480px slightly smaller logo.
- **Files:** `components.css`, `layout.css`.

