**Typography (Excellent rating per UI/UX Pro Max review):**
- Font: Navigo via Adobe Fonts (kit `lqh7ybe`) — replaced Archivo + IBM Plex Sans
- 2-weight system (400 + 700 only): tokens correctly map 500→400, 600/800→700
- Fluid clamp type scale: `--fs-hero/h1/h2/h3` for headings, `--fs-lede/body/ui/caption` for text
- Line-height: 1.15 headings, 1.6 body
- Text-wrap: `balance` on all headings, `pretty` on body
- All CTA buttons use `text-transform: uppercase` + 0.05em letter-spacing

**Accessibility:**
- Global `:focus-visible` (orange 2px outline)
- Skip-to-content link in header partial
- `prefers-reduced-motion` (CSS + JS guards)
- Carousel dots: `aria-selected`, off-screen slides `aria-hidden` + links tabindex -1
- Hero LCP img: `loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"`

**Design language:**
- Card radius: 0 (squared edges on all cards — `.mcat-card`, `.service-card`, `.category-card`, `.stat-pill`, `.testimonial-card`, `.news-feature`)
- Section padding: 88px vertical
- Interior rhythm: 32px gap between machine headline and content
- Unified card hover: lift + shadow across all card types
- Image zoom-on-hover in card shells (disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`)
- **Accent system:** `.accent` / `.accent--deep` in headlines; `.headline-rule` (48px orange bar) under section titles — same motif on testimonial card tops
- **Numbered editorial rows:** Barlow Condensed index numerals (`01 ·`, `02`–`04`) on Haas features band + news secondary items
- **Photo cards:** 105° left gradient + optional bottom scrim (hero, CTA, `.news-feature` lead)
- **Inverted light bands:** white bg + dark ink text (Haas features band `7080:2240`) — not dark-on-dark for multi-column capability grids
- **Haas watermark:** static, intro-only, layered via `.haas-relationship__bg` / `__content` — no parallax

**17 Unsplash stand-in images** placed across hero, intro, machine panels, testimonials, and news sections.

